After Aliyun site/APK deployment, both Python ssl and Windows curl/Schannel failed the TLS handshake to cn.magnetgoogo.com from the current Windows network. Server inspection confirmed Nginx uses `/etc/nginx/ssl/cn.magnetgoogo.com/fullchain.pem`, valid from 2026-07-31 through 2026-10-29. This is not an expired-certificate failure. Server files are verified locally; public-path verification will use K30S and a server-side HTTPS check.
